    {
      "key": "tc7f63bb2b3508006",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What is slippage in forex?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什么是外汇滑点？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t4512789b2a17c6cd",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What causes slippage in forex trading?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">是什么导致外汇交易滑点？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t2e5681e8192f0e0c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What is positive slippage?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什么是正滑点？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t038d16970cdc4a0d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Positive slippage occurs when an order executes at a price more favorable than expected. For a buy order, this means filling at a price below the expected price. For a sell order, it means filling above it. Positive slippage is still a form of slippage because the actual fill differs from the expected price.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">当订单以比预期更有利的价格成交时，就会出现正滑点。对买单而言，是成交价低于预期；对卖单而言，是成交价高于预期。正滑点仍属于滑点，因为实际成交价与预期不同。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "teb0ea22f1f1c116b",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">How do you calculate slippage?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">如何计算滑点？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t5d2fab53477e6541",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Compare the actual execution price with the price expected when the order was submitted, then convert the difference into the instrument's relevant points or pips. For buy orders, a higher fill is unfavorable and a lower fill is favorable. For sell orders, the interpretation is reversed.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">比较实际成交价与下单时预期的价格，再将差额换算为该金融工具相应的point或pip。对买单而言，较高的成交价不利，较低的成交价有利。卖单的情况相反。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t50e2ba2afdebd354",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Can slippage be completely avoided?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">可以完全避免滑点吗？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t6765804565101a8d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Is slippage the same as spread?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">滑点和点差一样吗？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "te3093e6f641e23b5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">No. Spread is the difference between the current bid and ask prices, while slippage is the difference between an expected or requested execution price and the actual fill price. A trade can experience both spread and slippage because they describe different aspects of pricing and execution.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">没有。点差是当前买入价和卖出价之间的差额，而滑点是预期或请求的执行价格与实际成交价格之间的差额。交易可能会经历点差和滑点，因为它们描述了定价和执行的不同方面。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t2a9b61af22450c1d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Is forex slippage different for traders in the UAE?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">阿联酋交易者的外汇滑点是否有所不同？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t69cd9215103fb5b1",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The basic mechanics of forex slippage are the same for UAE traders as elsewhere: execution depends on the available price when an order is filled. The specific platform settings, instruments, account terms, execution arrangements, and legal entity serving the client can differ, so traders should review the applicable broker documentation.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">对于阿联酋交易者来说，外汇滑点的基本机制与其他地方相同：执行取决于订单执行时的可用价格。具体的平台设置、工具、账户条款、执行安排和为客户提供服务的法律实体可能有所不同，因此交易者应查看适用的经纪商文件。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc57ed3c330dc070d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Understand Execution Before Placing an Order</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">下单前了解执行情况</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t00e9aedca978226c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Forex and CFD trading involves leverage and carries a high level of risk. Educational explanations of trading tools and execution mechanics do not guarantee a particular execution price, market outcome, or profit.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">外汇和差价合约交易涉及杠杆并具有高风险。对交易工具和执行机制的教育解释并不保证特定的执行价格、市场结果或利润。</span>"
    },
