        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">触发水平：1.1000</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0ba435a8908d1c8c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Order: Sell Stop at 1.1000</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">订单：在1.1000突破卖出（Sell Stop）</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tb4b9f297ff5609eb",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A triggered Sell Stop also becomes a market operation rather than guaranteeing execution exactly at the trigger level.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">已触发的突破卖出订单也会转为市价操作，并不保证恰好在触发价位成交。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9c37db5cd1650156",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Stop Order vs Stop-Loss Order</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">突破订单与止损订单</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "taa530400a8711b28",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A stop entry and a Stop Loss may both involve price triggers, but they have different jobs.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">突破入场订单和止损订单都可能涉及价格触发，但两者的用途不同。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "te253198b1656a2d1",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A Buy Stop or Sell Stop is used to open exposure after the market reaches a specified level.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">突破买入或突破卖出订单用于在市价达到指定水平后开仓。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t5037d5551ddeecd9",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A Stop Loss is a risk-management instruction associated with an open position or pending order and is intended to close exposure after a predefined adverse move.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">止损是与未平仓头寸或挂单相关的风险管理指令，旨在在预定义的不利走势后平仓。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf9a7bee306ef537d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is a Stop-Limit Order?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什么是突破回踩订单（Stop-Limit）？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t42c065919224ada5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A Stop-Limit combines a trigger price with a subsequent limit order.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">突破回踩订单将触发价格与随后创建的限价订单结合起来。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t90594418b5d5ff98",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">With a Buy Stop Limit, for example:</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">以突破回踩买入（Buy Stop Limit）为例：</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta1ab9e5f8b7d8bfd",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Market Order vs Limit Order vs Stop Order Comparison Table</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">市价单、限价单与突破单的比较表</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc35727c4565c91b0",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Market, limit and stop orders differ mainly in when they become executable and how much control the trader has over entry timing and price.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">市价单、限价单和突破单的主要区别，在于何时可以执行，以及交易者对入场时间和价格的控制程度。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc1069c74582cf322",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Execution Price</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">执行价格</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tba8db6ce8c917526",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Best For</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-invest-in-gold-in-the-uae#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-invest-in-gold-in-the-uae"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">最适合</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf8c9ef6b76208329",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Key Risk</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">主要风险</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta397d8b87484f402",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Slippage or a different final execution price</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">滑点或不同的最终执行价格</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t4188c5d56e9df9d1",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Limit price or better, subject to execution</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">限价或更好价格，以执行为准</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tebf01dcea57024dc",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Buying a pullback</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">回调买入</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf7f5845b3c893d4f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Order may remain unfilled</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">订单可能一直未成交</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tdd318cd5d0f89aeb",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Buy Stop</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">突破买入（Buy Stop）</span>"
    }
  ]
